Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Mobile player: mini bar + full-screen player, prev/next,
 drag seek, lock-screen controls; readable song rows and hero on phones

---
 README.md                |   8 ++
 app/static/app.js        | 286 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++----------
 app/static/style.css     |  77 ++++++++++-
 app/templates/index.html |  35 +++--
 tests/test_app.py        |   9 ++
